WEBVTT

NOTE Captions for the Trailhead roastery tour

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:03.480
Welcome to Trailhead Coffee Roasters.

2
00:00:04.480 --> 00:00:07.850
Every week, green coffee beans arrive at our roastery.

3
00:00:08.850 --> 00:00:11.850
We roast them in small batches on our drum roaster.

4
00:00:12.850 --> 00:00:16.360
Then we cup every batch, to taste it before you do.

5
00:00:17.360 --> 00:00:20.470
Fresh beans are packed by hand, the same day.

6
00:00:21.470 --> 00:00:24.960
And in the café, our baristas pour them into your cup.

7
00:00:25.960 --> 00:00:28.720
Come visit us, at the top of the trail.
